# use.tbl — the noun carries the verb: light verb + noun -> the Japanese verb the noun selects
#   noun | light verbs (comma-separated English lemmas) | japanese verb | class | particle on the noun | stative?
#   particle "-" drops the noun (take a rest -> 休む); a 6th field (any text) marks the result as stative (-> ている)
#   the noun may arrive as the object (make a decision) or as the complement of "to" (come to a decision -> 決定に達する)

